{"compact": {"ja_sv": "Utskottets förslag: att avslå motionsyrkandena (nuvarande ordning behålls).", "nej_sv": "Stöd för motförslaget: reservation 1 från V.", "avstar_sv": "Partiet markerar en egen linje som inte finns med i slutomröstningens två alternativ.", "ja_en": "The committee proposal: rejecting the motions (keeping things as they are).", "nej_en": "Backing the counter-proposal: reservation 1 by V.", "avstar_en": "The party marks a position of its own that is not one of the two final alternatives."}, "en": {"rubrik": "Changed Conditions for Student Support", "dok_titel": "Student Support", "forslag_text": "The Riksdag rejects the motions \n\n2025/26:462 by Lili André and Larry Söder (both KD), \n\n2025/26:957 by Lina Nordquist and Helene Odenjung (both L), \n\n2025/26:1079 by Sofia Skönnbrink et al. (S) demand 2, \n\n2025/26:1196 by Magnus Resare (M) demand 2, \n\n2025/26:2819 by Nooshi Dadgostar et al. (V) demand 1, \n\n2025/26:3753 by Lina Nordquist and Helene Odenjung (both L) and \n\n2025/26:3771 by Malte Tängmark Roos et al. (MP) demands 5-7.", "notis": "The Riksdag rejected approximately 50 proposals on student support in motions from the general motion submission period 2025. The proposals address among other things conditions for student support and student support for persons with limited educational background.\nThe Riksdag refers among other things to current regulations and to the fact that work is already underway in the areas that the proposals concern.", "alternatives": ["The Riksdag rejects the motions \n\n2025/26:462 by Lili André and Larry Söder (both KD), \n\n2025/26:957 by Lina Nordquist and Helene Odenjung (both L), \n\n2025/26:1079 by Sofia Skönnbrink et al. (S) demand 2, \n\n2025/26:1196 by Magnus Resare (M) demand 2, \n\n2025/26:2819 by Nooshi Dadgostar et al. (V) demand 1, \n\n2025/26:3753 by Lina Nordquist and Helene Odenjung (both L) and \n\n2025/26:3771 by Malte Tängmark Roos et al. (MP) demands 5-7.", "Reservation 1"]}, "votering